Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 19:16:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(claude): allow Auto mode on hosted providers

Claude Code supports Auto mode on Bedrock and Vertex, but Paseo removed it from the catalog and rejected explicit selections before reaching Claude Code. Remove that obsolete eligibility gate while preserving the existing default modes and SDK error handling.

Fork-patch: upstream PR getpaseo/paseo#6904 (fixes #5076), commit
26dd2c5a902655a74d4162ee0f9c322f9d08ddd1, rebased onto v0.13.2. Only the
diff context changed; the +/- lines are identical to the PR. Drop this
patch once #6904 is in a release tag.
